{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-13_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-13",
  "title": "突破外围防线",
  "storyCode": "14-15",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-13_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fb6893f49cf6de1cb3a218379f2789b4074a705f16765ec5b16698c427bb6bc0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "还有吗？下一个要被炸成碎片的怪影子在哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪异的影子",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "啧，还真有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "W小姐，削减它们的数量恐怕没有意义，它们不过是死魂灵力量的投影。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "只要死魂灵还寄宿在这艘船上，它的这些造物就无穷无尽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "这只是它拖延时间的手段。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "那我就再给这艘船添几个窟窿，直到死魂灵疼到决定灵魂出窍怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "恐怕不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "这艘船的一切都不过是死魂灵的躯壳，就算破坏了这艘船的外壳，甚至把飞空艇炸成了两段，死魂灵依然可以用巫术力量保证它的运行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "哪怕这种运行只是暂时的，也足够他们接触到“阿喃那”了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "想要彻底停下飞空艇，我们必须找到并摧毁死魂灵的核心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "不是我说，我们萨卡兹的怪东西还真多，真不让人省心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "就不能靠炸弹直接解决问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "一整个高速战舰编队的主炮齐射也许能彻底摧毁它的外壳，让它用巫术也无法轻易维持自己的运作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "好吧，那我们就去找那个什么核心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "总有一天我也要给自己搞门炮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们怎么才能找到死魂灵的核心？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我并不十分确定，作为这艘飞空艇真正的中枢，它一定被层层保护，小心地藏匿在了某个舱室中。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "只有深入飞空艇我们才能查出它的蛛丝马迹。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "这同时意味着，我们的敌人阻击我们也会变得轻而易举。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "时间来不及。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "死魂灵对于飞空艇的掌握是绝对的吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "理论上是。但飞空艇体积庞大，它的注意力也是有限的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "伊内丝来过这艘船，她不也全须全尾地逃出来了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "哈，当然也有可能是因为她不是个彻头彻尾的萨卡兹。她感受不到死魂灵精神上的压迫。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们需要分工合作。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们需要想办法分散死魂灵的注意力。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士，你的意思是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "人在剧痛时不会注意到虫子爬上了裤脚。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W，我需要你的帮助。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "......啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "说实话，这是不是你早就筹划好的陷阱，就等着现在说呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你是最合适的人选。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "text": "哈。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你在制造动静这一块无人能及。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "text": "这我倒不否认。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "text": "好吧，争取时间，又是争取时间。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "text": "但事先说好了，这次我不是你们的饵。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "若死魂灵比我们想象的要更加敏锐......",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你对阿米娅使了个眼色，阿米娅一愣，轻轻向你点了点头。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W，点火。",
          "value": "5",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "现在，动静够了吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "那么，虫子们，别被轻易找到。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "......在见到她之前。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "博士，阿米娅，沿着W打开的缺口进入飞空艇内部。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "跟紧我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我们的机会，只有一次。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "空空荡荡的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "看来，军事委员会已经撤走了全部的乘员，他们也知道这次行动的危险性。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凯尔希，如果飞空艇真的与“阿喃那”相碰撞......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "到那时，会发生什么？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "“阿喃那”会同化它所接触的一切信息。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "这些信息中，包含了所有的有机物，无机物，乃至人格，情感......所有的一切，都会被源石的结晶包覆。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "那特蕾西娅小姐与死魂灵......！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "是的，选择驶向那里，意味着他们很清楚这个结果。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他们究竟想从源石中得到什么？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "低沉沧桑的声音从船舱的深处响起。\n但是没有人影，走廊中仍然空空荡荡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这声音......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......很熟悉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "在这个地方，它的声音......能让我们所有人听见。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......死魂灵。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "它还是注意到我们了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "只是一眨眼的时间，无数古怪的阴影就填满了原本空空荡荡的走廊。\n死魂灵的话语也从它们的震动中发出。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "Mon3tr，准备战斗！阿米娅，保护博士！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "漆黑的长矛一瞬间就在阿米娅的指尖凝结，随即飞射而出。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "可它却被墙壁与楼梯啃食得一干二净。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "敌人太多，我们需要转移！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "可每一条走廊都是那么相似，每一条楼梯连接的仿佛都是相同的空间。\n这些不过是死魂灵的血管，而它的意志，却可以在任何地方浮现。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......不行，我们甩不掉它们！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是时候了，W！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "巨大的爆炸让你睁不开眼，但计划仍按照你原本想象的那样被执行着。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "小兔子，换边！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "凯尔希，让你养的小怪物抓住这个累赘，我们要快速——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "等等，这里......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "突然，不祥的预感在你心头猛然炸响。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "情况不对——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "W炸弹的威力，不会有这么大！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "借着爆炸的余威，整条走廊在它主人的命令之下撕裂了。\n你感觉自己正滑向下一层的走廊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "喂，老女人——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你努力维持住平衡，向凯尔希原本所在的位置看去，却只能看见凯尔希被漆黑的阴影所吞没。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "死魂灵自己撕裂了这里的结构！它想——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "巨大的坍塌声传来，阿米娅消失在了正在崩溃的走廊的另一头。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "啧——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "小兔子，等着。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "一道黑影闪过，扑开了你和W，在你们侧身的刹那，巫术的锋刃就切过了你们刚刚所在的地方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "（焦躁的嘶鸣）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "它还是没能钩住你的衣领，你向着下层的走廊滚去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "text": "（催促的吼叫）",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "在你重重地摔在下层地板上之前，一只手拎住了你的后领。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "抓住你了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "不，应该说，你终于落在我手里了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "“嘎吱”......“嘎吱”......“嘎吱”......\n钢铁扭曲的声音回荡在狭小的空间内，舰艇在咀嚼腔体内的黑暗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "为了迫使我落入这处封闭的陷阱，你做了很多——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "死魂灵。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "如今的你，是否连自己的名字都已忘记了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "无人回应。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "“嘎吱”......唯有金属拉扯的声音在蔓延。锐利的碎屑不断从舰体上被剥落，被牵引......\n凯尔希知道，如果将此时此刻这处未知的空间，比作一间充斥着磁场的房间——\n那么牵引所有致命之物的中心，一定就是她自己。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "威胁？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "看来尽管已经燃烧自己多年，你依旧保有理智。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "但如果你混乱的意识里，还留存了一点曾经在卡兹戴尔的记忆......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "你应当清楚，死亡的威胁，对我毫无意义。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "寂静。\n但凯尔希能够感知到，那些将自己裹挟至此处的阴影仍在黑暗中注视她。\n伺机待发。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "不，你理应知道......毕竟特蕾西娅她很清楚这一点。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "你也在听，对吧——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "特蕾西娅。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我能在这艘舰艇上感受到你的意志。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我本以为，你会在这里等我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "凯尔希伸手轻触墙壁，感受着这艘舰艇的生命。\n冰冷粗糙的金属......以及源石。\n尽管在黑暗之中，凯尔希依旧能清楚地看到，那些源石正在生长，以及同化周边的一切——\n但独独避开了她的手指所触及的位置。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "源石的自然增殖，如今已经可以被你影响到如此地步......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "如果这些源石继续生长下去，整艘飞空艇会在撞上那里之前完成结晶化......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "那其中的所有人都——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "也包括我？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "这就是你想告诉我的事情？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "无人应答。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "最初的源石，你，特雷西斯，萨卡兹......我原以为自己对你的计划已经有了足够的猜测。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "但恐怕你走得比我所猜想的更远......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "即使将我困在这里，我也不认为你真正提防的人是我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "你总是做出一些令我也很头疼的事情，特蕾西娅，就像过去一样。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......和过去一样。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "特蕾西娅，现在的你，是否还相信......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "泰拉还能有一个“未来”？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "阴影从凯尔希的脚下延展。\n漆黑的海洋从黑暗中涌出，转瞬便要淹没其中的一切。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "果然——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "黑暗再次恢复了宁静。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
